#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:271
msgid "Config Caching"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:275
msgid ""
"Do not use this feature unless you have carefully read this section and "
"understand how this feature works. Otherwise, your application will not "
"function properly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:279
msgid "To improve performance, Config Caching has been implemented."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:282
msgid "Prerequisite"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:284
msgid ""
"Using this feature when the prerequisites are not met will prevent "
"CodeIgniter from operating properly. Do not use this feature in such "
"cases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:287
msgid ""
"To use this feature, the properties of all Config objects instantiated in"
" Factories must not be modified after instantiation. Put another way, the"
" Config classes must be an immutable or readonly classes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:290
msgid ""
"By default, every Config class that is cached must implement "
"``__set_state()`` method."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:294
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:296
msgid ""
"Once cached, configuration values are never changed until the cache is "
"deleted, even if the configuration file or **.env** is changed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:299
msgid ""
"Save the all Config instances in Factories into a cache file before "
"shutdown, if the state of the Config instances in Factories changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:301
msgid ""
"Restore cached Config instances before CodeIgniter initialization if a "
"cache is available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:304
msgid ""
"Simply put, all Config instances held by Factories are cached immediately"
" prior to shutdown, and the cached instances are used permanently."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:308
msgid "How to Update Config Values"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:310
msgid ""
"Once stored, the cached versions never expire. Changing a existing Config"
" file (or changing Environment Variables for it) will not update the "
"cache nor the Config values."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:314
msgid ""
"So if you want to update Config values, update Config files or "
"Environment Variables for them, and you must manually delete the cache "
"file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:317
msgid "You can use the ``spark cache:clear`` command:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:323
msgid "Or simply delete the **writable/cache/FactoriesCache_config** file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/concepts/factories.rst:326
msgid "Since v4.5.0, the ``spark optimize`` command clears the cache."
msgstr ""

